  "notes": [
    "Eleven focused checks include one playable yard, four duplex checks and six native wire/bulb/tool checks.",
    "The single wire-family fixture exercises all 57 ordinary CEE variants, independently; cosmetic variants retain native behavior.",
    "The published CEE node helper disagrees with its registered geometry. Independent orientation coverage checks 72 native node identities.",
    "No native bulb or dye hook was added: corrected fixtures follow the actual two-click replacement and native colored-wire arrays.",
    "Two instrumented cold boots reproduce bulk=0 followed by single=-0.069914047614574315 V; native Lua calls sample separate ticks.",
    "The later native-wiring jar also runs wwpg volts on actual computer startup; its full-profile and yard checks are recorded separately when complete.",
    "The historical Windows/native combined Nether-unload assertion failure remains unproven; this stage does not claim to close it.",
    "Final eight-way packaged acceptance, exact ZIP reopening, graphical and two-real-client checks remain required."
  ]
